        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://townoffrankton.in.gov/history-of-frankton/"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s name honors founder Jacob Sigler and his son Francis, whose initials inspired the “Fran‑ton” designation.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4,
        11,
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://townoffrankton.in.gov/history-of-frankton/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Frankton hosts a branch of the North Madison County Public Library System, offering residents a quiet place to read.",
